|x12 gB2 n22 vddr2 0 ro_stage wstv=0.44
|VnB2 gB2 n12 0 dc 0 trnoise(2.0e-3 2e-10 0 0)
|x22 gC2 n32 vddr2 0 ro_stage wstv=0.44
|VnC2 gC2 n22 0 dc 0 trnoise(2.0e-3 2e-10 0 0)
|x32 gD2 n42 vddr2 0 ro_stage wstv=0.44
