|* --- ring 4, wstv = 0.48 ---
|xg4 gA4 en4 n14 vddr4 0 ro_nand2 wstv=0.48
|VnA4 gA4 ro4raw 0 dc 0 trnoise(2.0e-3 2e-10 0 0)
|x14 gB4 n24 vddr4 0 ro_stage wstv=0.48
|VnB4 gB4 n14 0 dc 0 trnoise(2.0e-3 2e-10 0 0)
|x24 gC4 n34 vddr4 0 ro_stage wstv=0.48
|VnC4 gC4 n24 0 dc 0 trnoise(2.0e-3 2e-10 0 0)
|x34 gD4 n44 vddr4 0 ro_stage wstv=0.48
